# Testing rules

Read `spec/07-monorepo-testing-strategy.md` before adding or changing tests.

## Before writing tests

State: target layer (unit | integration | component | contract | e2e), and what is mocked vs real.

## Conventions

- Prefer `*.spec.ts`; Vitest; AAA structure.
- Mock external IO in unit tests; do not mock the business rules under test.
- Backend integration: Fastify injection preferred.
- Folders: `tests/unit`, `integration`, `contract`, `component`, `e2e` per app.

## CI order

Typecheck → unit → backend integration + frontend component (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`).
